# Skill Quality Standards

Canonical rule: `rules/dev/skill-quality-standards.md`.

Skills in `skills/<domain>/<name>/` ship via `.claude-plugin/plugin.json`, `.cursor-plugin/plugin.json`, and `.codex-plugin/plugin.json`. Keep bodies portable — do not assume Claude Code only.

- All 16 frontmatter fields + `metadata.updated-date` required; run `make validate`
- Directory name = slash command name = frontmatter `name`
- Use `$CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR` in Claude-oriented script paths; Cursor/Codex resolve the skill directory containing `SKILL.md`
- Never hand-write a new skill from scratch — use `skill-creator`
